WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.300
The same link can open for one person, and stay shut for another.

00:00:07.405 --> 00:00:09.674
Here's how sharing works on Markdrop.

00:00:10.774 --> 00:00:14.134
Every document and file has one setting: who can open it.

00:00:14.645 --> 00:00:15.605
Anyone with the link.

00:00:15.745 --> 00:00:16.485
Your team.

00:00:16.685 --> 00:00:18.185
Or only the people you add.

00:00:18.729 --> 00:00:20.929
One setting covers every address it has.

00:00:23.011 --> 00:00:27.091
Add people by email, with Can view or Can edit, and a note if you like.

00:00:29.671 --> 00:00:33.511
They sign in with that address, and it's waiting for them under Shared with me.

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:37.613
Everyone else sees that it's private.

00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:41.307
Even the link preview leaves out the title and the text.

00:00:43.818 --> 00:00:45.398
Someone without access can ask.

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:51.445
You get an email with their note, and answer with one click: let them view, let them edit, or decline.

00:00:53.993 --> 00:00:55.273
Sharing a link more widely?

00:00:55.773 --> 00:00:57.613
Add a password, or set it to expire.

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:01.193
When it expires, it's deleted, not just hidden.

00:01:03.613 --> 00:01:05.306
Change your mind any time.

00:01:05.606 --> 00:01:08.106
Remove someone, and they lose access straight away.

00:01:10.709 --> 00:01:14.280
See every sharing option at docs.markdrop.in.
